--
-- The original testbench has been modified to directly test the cmdProc component.
-- This simplifies debugging by removing dependencies on other components,
-- for example, UART interfaces and Data Processor.
--
-- This modified testbench will only focus on testing the cmdProc component's response
-- to specific commands, 'L' and 'P'.
-- We will provide input commands directly and verify responses, 
-- without simulating the full system with UART and data processing.
