-- The following components are no longer needed for direct testing cmdProc:
-- dataConsume_synthesis.vhd
-- dataConsume_wrapper.vhd
-- UART_RX_CTRL.vhd
-- UART_TX_CTRL.vhd
-- datGen.vhd
--
-- However, after we are fully functional with cmdProc component, we will test it using the original testbench.

